## What Are Red Teaming Services?

Red teaming is a cybersecurity assessment that simulates realistic attack scenarios to evaluate an organization's people, processes, and technology. Authorized security professionals test security controls to identify weaknesses and assess how effectively an organization detects and responds to potential attacks.

Unlike traditional vulnerability assessments, red teaming focuses on evaluating the overall effectiveness of an organization's security defenses.

