## Key Features of Red Teaming Services

Professional red teaming assessments may include external attack simulations, internal network security testing, identity and access control assessments, authorized phishing simulations, and evaluations of security monitoring and incident response capabilities.

All activities should be conducted with appropriate authorization, a clearly defined scope, and safeguards to minimize disruption to business operations.

After the assessment, organizations receive a detailed report describing the scenarios tested, security weaknesses identified, potential business impact, and recommended improvements. Follow-up assessments can help verify whether the recommended security measures have been implemented effectively.

